WEBVTT

00:00:07.650 --> 00:00:09.280
Good morning, Run-chan.

00:00:09.940 --> 00:00:11.440
Morning.

00:00:11.440 --> 00:00:12.900
Got your panties?

00:00:12.900 --> 00:00:15.870
Of course! I'm awake and alert this time!

00:00:17.240 --> 00:00:19.490
Come on! Let's go!

00:00:23.410 --> 00:00:24.620
Run-chan...

00:02:08.440 --> 00:02:11.190
There's nothing like a fizzy drink to wake you up!

00:02:11.190 --> 00:02:12.900
Don't people usually drink coffee?

00:02:12.900 --> 00:02:13.900
Really?

00:02:13.900 --> 00:02:16.030
Soda goes all fwoosh and makes your eyes flutter,

00:02:16.030 --> 00:02:17.740
so you wake up right away!

00:02:17.740 --> 00:02:18.910
Is that how it goes?

00:02:20.990 --> 00:02:22.200
Nice shot.

00:02:23.620 --> 00:02:27.160
Come to think of it, I haven't seen Tooru yet today.

00:02:27.160 --> 00:02:28.290
She has cleaning duty today,

00:02:28.290 --> 00:02:30.500
so she said she'd be busy this morning.

00:02:30.790 --> 00:02:31.710
Really?

00:02:32.460 --> 00:02:34.250
It feels like we're always together,

00:02:34.250 --> 00:02:35.590
so it's lonely when she's not around.

00:02:35.840 --> 00:02:37.130
You're right.

00:02:37.130 --> 00:02:39.180
But if she's on duty, there's no helping it.

00:02:40.970 --> 00:02:41.840
That's right.

00:02:42.600 --> 00:02:44.180
What is it, Nagi?

00:02:45.470 --> 00:02:46.600
Say,

00:02:46.600 --> 00:02:48.230
want to go take a look?

00:02:49.390 --> 00:02:50.440
At what?

00:02:51.350 --> 00:02:53.690
First-year student, Tooru!

00:03:00.570 --> 00:03:02.370
Look at this graffiti!

00:03:02.370 --> 00:03:04.030
It's still there.

00:03:04.580 --> 00:03:06.870
It's carved in, so it'll probably stay.

00:03:06.870 --> 00:03:08.370
Anyway, let's get a move on.

00:03:10.210 --> 00:03:11.750
Wait for me!

00:03:15.130 --> 00:03:17.760
Seeing the first-year rooms brings back memories.

00:03:18.010 --> 00:03:19.970
It hasn't been all that long, though.

00:03:20.510 --> 00:03:24.260
Ah, isn't that Tooru's classroom?

00:03:28.390 --> 00:03:31.190
I wonder what Tooru's like in class?

00:03:31.190 --> 00:03:33.150
Maybe everyone's afraid of her?

00:03:33.440 --> 00:03:36.110
Surprisingly, Tooru's an honor student!

00:03:36.110 --> 00:03:37.020
No way!

00:03:37.020 --> 00:03:38.650
I thought she'd be a delinquent!

00:03:38.650 --> 00:03:39.570
That's right!

00:03:39.570 --> 00:03:44.030
S-Swinging around that bat, staining the room with blood...

00:03:44.030 --> 00:03:45.780
No, I don't think so...

00:03:46.620 --> 00:03:48.490
Sensei, we're done with these.

00:03:48.830 --> 00:03:51.120
Ah, thanks as always.

00:03:51.120 --> 00:03:54.710
Um, there was a mistake in the number of boys written here,

00:03:54.710 --> 00:03:56.540
so I corrected it.

00:03:56.540 --> 00:03:57.460
Is that okay?

00:03:58.050 --> 00:03:59.710
Oh my, you're right.

00:03:59.710 --> 00:04:01.380
That must have been my mistake.

00:04:01.920 --> 00:04:04.220
Thank you! You were a big help.

00:04:04.220 --> 00:04:06.010
No, it was nothing.

00:04:06.470 --> 00:04:08.390
To-o-ru!

00:04:09.810 --> 00:04:12.190
"It was nothing," she says.

00:04:12.190 --> 00:04:13.600
What a good girl!

00:04:13.600 --> 00:04:16.690
So reliable. Nudge nudge.

00:04:22.280 --> 00:04:23.240
Umm...

00:04:24.490 --> 00:04:26.240
I forgot my textbook,

00:04:26.240 --> 00:04:28.160
so can I look on with you?

00:04:28.740 --> 00:04:29.540
Sure.

00:04:29.540 --> 00:04:30.910
Thank you so much!

00:04:36.170 --> 00:04:37.670
Sorry.

00:04:37.670 --> 00:04:39.960
I forgot my contacts today, too.

00:04:40.300 --> 00:04:42.510
I-I see.

00:04:43.590 --> 00:04:45.010
Ah, I can't see...

00:04:50.720 --> 00:04:52.680
Thank you very much!

00:04:53.390 --> 00:04:54.640
You saved me there!

00:04:55.310 --> 00:04:55.850
Don't mention it.

00:04:55.900 --> 00:04:58.360
My name is Yutaka!

00:04:58.360 --> 00:05:01.860
I've actually been meaning to talk with you!

00:05:01.860 --> 00:05:03.190
I just never had the opportunity.

00:05:03.400 --> 00:05:04.610
I-I see...

00:05:05.320 --> 00:05:07.990
Let's be friends, please!

00:05:07.990 --> 00:05:08.740
Toorun!

00:05:09.870 --> 00:05:10.580
Huh?!

00:05:14.910 --> 00:05:16.580
As a sign of our friendship,

00:05:16.580 --> 00:05:18.460
let me buy you a juice!

00:05:18.460 --> 00:05:19.170
Wait!

00:05:19.170 --> 00:05:20.550
What did you just-

00:05:26.840 --> 00:05:28.430
Huh? Tooru?

00:05:36.060 --> 00:05:37.190
What's wrong?

00:05:42.230 --> 00:05:43.030
What is it?

00:05:43.030 --> 00:05:44.400
This is unusual.

00:05:46.820 --> 00:05:48.660
Are you squeezing me or something?

00:05:48.660 --> 00:05:50.280
Ow-ow-ow-ow!

00:05:50.280 --> 00:05:52.580
Ow-ow-ow-ow-ow...

00:05:56.290 --> 00:05:58.290
Thanks for waiting, Toorun!

00:05:58.290 --> 00:06:00.290
I bought some more!

00:06:00.290 --> 00:06:01.920
Huh? Toorun?

00:06:01.920 --> 00:06:03.340
Where did you go?

00:06:03.340 --> 00:06:04.170
Toorun!

00:06:31.620 --> 00:06:33.030
Can I have a moment?

00:06:36.120 --> 00:06:36.700
Yes?

00:06:44.000 --> 00:06:46.300
Run's talking with a strange man...

00:06:47.420 --> 00:06:50.800
And plus, what's with the design on that shirt?

00:06:56.470 --> 00:06:57.560
Nagi-chan!

00:06:57.560 --> 00:06:59.770
H-Hey, who was that?

00:06:59.770 --> 00:07:02.230
He says he's the new nurse.

00:07:02.230 --> 00:07:04.070
Seems like he got lost.

00:07:04.650 --> 00:07:06.230
So that's who he was.

00:07:06.230 --> 00:07:08.280
I thought he was someone suspicious at first.

00:07:08.650 --> 00:07:10.660
Also, he complimented me,

00:07:10.660 --> 00:07:12.700
saying, "Your forehead is beautiful. It's very nice"!

00:07:13.450 --> 00:07:15.660
And you didn't find that... strange?

00:07:17.240 --> 00:07:20.250
Really? We have a new school nurse?

00:07:21.040 --> 00:07:23.210
He looks really shady, though.

00:07:24.210 --> 00:07:26.880
I bet the girls will like him, though.

00:07:27.420 --> 00:07:28.920
And there he is again!

00:07:28.920 --> 00:07:30.380
Thanks for before.

00:07:30.380 --> 00:07:31.470
You really helped me out.

00:07:31.470 --> 00:07:33.800
Oh no, no need to thank me.

00:07:33.800 --> 00:07:34.720
Ah, yes.

00:07:34.720 --> 00:07:36.890
You should drop by the nurse's office one of these days.

00:07:36.890 --> 00:07:38.890
I'll have a special bed prepared for you.

00:07:39.850 --> 00:07:41.190
Sensei, you're funny!

00:07:41.480 --> 00:07:42.940
Come whenever you like.

00:07:44.190 --> 00:07:46.130
Something's been moving around for a while...

00:07:58.910 --> 00:07:59.410
You are...

00:08:00.250 --> 00:08:02.330
Don't act so friendly with Run-chan!

00:08:02.330 --> 00:08:05.250
I see. So you're called Run-chan.

00:08:05.250 --> 00:08:07.380
May I call you Run-chan as well?

00:08:07.380 --> 00:08:08.420
Sure!

00:08:08.880 --> 00:08:11.300
I see. Run-chan.

00:08:11.300 --> 00:08:13.130
How adorable. Run-chan.

00:08:14.470 --> 00:08:16.100
You look like a sea urchin,

00:08:16.100 --> 00:08:16.800
so you'll be Uni-chan.

00:08:19.640 --> 00:08:20.980
She looks depressed.

00:08:21.350 --> 00:08:23.690
He's sure being infuriatingly nice.

00:08:23.890 --> 00:08:28.320
Ah, but Run-chan, your forehead really is adorable.

00:08:28.570 --> 00:08:30.190
Thank you very much.

00:08:30.690 --> 00:08:33.450
That's right... it really is...

00:08:34.320 --> 00:08:35.950
Really...

00:08:41.080 --> 00:08:42.460
Get away from Run-chan!

00:08:44.170 --> 00:08:46.460
E-Excuse me.

00:08:46.460 --> 00:08:48.460
It's time for my medicine.

00:08:48.460 --> 00:08:50.840
<i>Ah, so his body is weak.</i>

00:08:54.090 --> 00:08:55.260
Oh yeah!

00:08:55.260 --> 00:08:56.340
Look at this!

00:08:56.760 --> 00:08:57.850
Ta-dah!

00:08:58.640 --> 00:09:01.100
No music, no life!

00:09:02.560 --> 00:09:04.850
You got the limited edition color one!

00:09:04.850 --> 00:09:06.350
Oh. I did?

00:09:06.350 --> 00:09:09.820
Aw, man, I want one so bad.

00:09:09.820 --> 00:09:11.110
How very high-tech.

00:09:11.820 --> 00:09:13.610
What sort of music do you listen to, Run?

00:09:14.860 --> 00:09:16.610
Umm...

00:09:17.070 --> 00:09:19.490
I'm still living a No Music Life.

00:09:19.490 --> 00:09:20.830
You couldn't put anything on this?

00:09:23.950 --> 00:09:25.870
I tried a bunch of different ways,

00:09:25.870 --> 00:09:29.130
but I couldn't get any music on it, so I thought it was broken.

00:09:30.090 --> 00:09:31.000
I tried that...

00:09:33.300 --> 00:09:34.260
and this...

00:09:36.260 --> 00:09:37.510
and that...

00:09:41.760 --> 00:09:42.850
Yeah...

00:09:45.520 --> 00:09:47.440
But it just wouldn't work.

00:09:47.440 --> 00:09:49.360
What was the last one there? The last one!

00:09:49.690 --> 00:09:51.070
You took it apart?!

00:09:51.070 --> 00:09:53.190
Well, I thought it was broken.

00:09:53.190 --> 00:09:55.690
And you thought an amateur could fix it?!

00:09:55.690 --> 00:09:58.360
You could have sent it back to the manufacturer or something!

00:09:58.610 --> 00:10:00.120
Calm down!

00:10:00.120 --> 00:10:01.780
Nagi, it's not like it was yours.

00:10:01.810 --> 00:10:04.330
If it were mine, I'd have taken <i>you</i> apart!

00:10:04.330 --> 00:10:05.580
Don't worry!

00:10:05.580 --> 00:10:08.870
I'm not broken, so you don't have to.

00:10:08.870 --> 00:10:10.790
That's not what I meant!

00:10:15.050 --> 00:10:16.050
It's on!

00:10:16.050 --> 00:10:17.970
Ah, thank goodness!

00:10:18.260 --> 00:10:21.140
Run, to put music on this,

00:10:21.140 --> 00:10:22.810
you have to use a computer.

00:10:24.350 --> 00:10:24.770
Huh?

00:10:29.940 --> 00:10:31.560
I don't have one.

00:10:31.560 --> 00:10:32.650
So why'd you buy that?

00:10:35.360 --> 00:10:39.570
Um, where do you go off to every break?

00:10:43.200 --> 00:10:46.080
I won't let go 'till you tell me~

00:10:56.880 --> 00:10:57.840
I was kidding!

00:10:57.840 --> 00:10:59.050
Toorun, wait!

00:11:00.220 --> 00:11:02.090
I'm sorry! I'm sorry!

00:11:02.090 --> 00:11:03.600
Are you angry?

00:11:03.600 --> 00:11:05.010
I'm not.

00:11:07.890 --> 00:11:09.440
It got so stretched...

00:11:09.440 --> 00:11:11.810
It'll go back when I wash it, so don't worry.

00:11:11.810 --> 00:11:14.520
No! This is useful in its own way!

00:11:19.570 --> 00:11:21.740
Now, where are we headed?

00:11:21.740 --> 00:11:23.570
Yutaka shall pull you there!

00:11:28.120 --> 00:11:28.950
Run-chan?

00:11:35.420 --> 00:11:36.300
I see.

00:11:37.170 --> 00:11:39.220
They have gym next.

00:13:09.140 --> 00:13:10.600
But man,

00:13:11.270 --> 00:13:14.390
I can't believe we're still wearing bloomers.

00:13:14.390 --> 00:13:15.810
That's for sure.

00:13:16.310 --> 00:13:18.520
They wear shorts in other schools.

00:13:21.570 --> 00:13:23.860
Bloomers are practically panties.

00:13:24.610 --> 00:13:27.610
And we're already wearing panties underneath...

00:13:28.280 --> 00:13:29.830
It's panties-on-panties.

00:13:30.240 --> 00:13:30.740
Nagi?

00:13:31.040 --> 00:13:33.620
There's something wrong with a class where we wear panties.

00:13:34.910 --> 00:13:37.290
"They're not panties, so it's not embarassing"?!

00:13:37.290 --> 00:13:38.960
It sure as heck is!

00:13:40.880 --> 00:13:43.550
Nagi, you're being way more embarassing than the bloomers!

00:13:43.960 --> 00:13:47.890
The way you keep saying that makes it sound like you like it.

00:13:49.010 --> 00:13:51.220
Start warming up!

00:13:51.970 --> 00:13:52.680
Hup.

00:13:55.180 --> 00:13:55.810
Hey.

00:13:56.100 --> 00:13:57.770
What is it, Yuuko-chan?

00:13:58.190 --> 00:13:59.980
Do we pull for this?

00:13:59.980 --> 00:14:01.610
I thought we push.

00:14:01.610 --> 00:14:02.730
Oh, really?

00:14:02.730 --> 00:14:04.490
Then let's do it on "go".

00:14:04.490 --> 00:14:05.190
All right!

00:14:05.690 --> 00:14:06.950
Ready, go!

00:14:10.820 --> 00:14:13.580
<i>What are those two doing?</i>

00:14:14.500 --> 00:14:14.950
Hup!

00:14:15.950 --> 00:14:18.370
I guess we were supposed to pull on the last one.

00:14:18.620 --> 00:14:20.500
Guess we were, Yuuko-chan.

00:14:28.720 --> 00:14:30.510
We got this one right!

00:14:30.510 --> 00:14:32.550
Looks like you're enjoying yourselves.

00:14:35.680 --> 00:14:36.890
If you keep goofing off,

00:14:36.890 --> 00:14:38.100
you're going to hurt yourselves.

00:14:38.100 --> 00:14:39.770
We'll be okay!

00:14:44.570 --> 00:14:45.150
Huh?

00:14:45.610 --> 00:14:47.190
What's wrong, Nagi-chan?

00:14:47.570 --> 00:14:49.610
N-Nothing!

00:14:51.070 --> 00:14:53.080
Okay! On to the next question.

00:15:04.500 --> 00:15:07.380
<i>Toorun, you looking at Yutaka?</i>

00:15:11.090 --> 00:15:13.140
<i>No mistake about it!</i>

00:15:13.800 --> 00:15:15.970
Can Yutaka help you?

00:15:15.970 --> 00:15:16.680
Outta the way.

00:15:30.320 --> 00:15:32.780
Okay! Who can solve this problem?

00:15:32.780 --> 00:15:34.580
My, a volunteer.

00:15:37.870 --> 00:15:39.410
You mean Yutaka?

00:15:39.410 --> 00:15:40.620
Of course.

00:15:40.620 --> 00:15:41.960
Go on, come to the front.

00:15:51.430 --> 00:15:52.510
<i>Toorun!</i>

00:15:58.060 --> 00:15:59.310
Yuuko-chan!

00:16:00.100 --> 00:16:03.440
Try leaving that out instead of tucking it in!

00:16:03.440 --> 00:16:04.520
You mean my gym uniform?

00:16:11.280 --> 00:16:14.530
Mm-hmm. Not wearing any.

00:16:14.820 --> 00:16:16.280
Nagi-chan, look quick!

00:16:16.280 --> 00:16:18.660
Yuuko-chan's not wearing anything below! Nothing!

00:16:18.660 --> 00:16:20.330
Run, don't shout so loud!

00:16:21.250 --> 00:16:23.370
... is what happened.

00:16:23.370 --> 00:16:25.790
Tooru, you're in your gym uniform, too.

00:16:25.790 --> 00:16:27.380
You want me to untuck it?

00:16:32.090 --> 00:16:34.380
I'm afraid it won't meet your expectations.

00:16:35.930 --> 00:16:37.300
Ah! This is...

00:16:37.800 --> 00:16:39.850
just a one-piece dress!

00:16:40.930 --> 00:16:42.680
You sure tuck that in well!

00:16:43.690 --> 00:16:44.850
<i>She complimented me!</i>

00:16:46.230 --> 00:16:47.440
Toorun.

00:16:51.900 --> 00:16:52.990
That's...

00:16:55.780 --> 00:16:59.330
Okay! Let's get started!

00:16:59.330 --> 00:17:01.160
We'll be doing warm-ups,

00:17:01.160 --> 00:17:02.660
so get into pairs.

00:17:07.420 --> 00:17:09.590
Tooruuun!

00:17:10.590 --> 00:17:12.590
Please partner with Yutaka!

00:17:18.300 --> 00:17:19.640
Ah. Miporin.

00:17:20.100 --> 00:17:22.470
Yutaka, you'll be my partner, right?

00:17:22.470 --> 00:17:25.690
Uh? Yutaka wants to partner with Toorun-

00:17:25.690 --> 00:17:26.980
With me, right?

00:17:29.150 --> 00:17:30.820
With me, <i>right?</i>

00:17:32.530 --> 00:17:33.650
Then let's go over here.

00:17:33.940 --> 00:17:35.360
Miporin...

00:17:42.370 --> 00:17:43.750
Hey, Yuuko.

00:17:43.750 --> 00:17:45.620
Got any band-aids?

00:17:45.620 --> 00:17:47.460
Why? Are you hurt?

00:17:47.460 --> 00:17:50.590
Well, when I fell down in gym earlier,

00:17:50.590 --> 00:17:52.090
I scraped my knee.

00:17:52.380 --> 00:17:55.590
Oh no! You'd better put on some disinfectant.

00:17:56.010 --> 00:17:57.340
Let's go to the nurse's office.

00:17:57.340 --> 00:18:01.600
Huh? A rinse and a band-aid should be good enough.

00:18:01.600 --> 00:18:03.020
That's no good!

00:18:03.020 --> 00:18:05.270
If it gets infected, you'll regret it!

00:18:05.270 --> 00:18:06.560
I'm telling you, it's fine.

00:18:06.940 --> 00:18:09.230
Besides, class is about to start.

00:18:09.230 --> 00:18:11.190
Forget that, come on!

00:18:11.190 --> 00:18:11.730
Hold on!

00:18:13.570 --> 00:18:15.280
I told you, I'm fine!

00:18:15.940 --> 00:18:17.200
And I say no!

00:18:19.320 --> 00:18:21.200
Wonder what happened?

00:18:21.740 --> 00:18:22.990
Excuse u...

00:18:30.460 --> 00:18:31.670
Yuuko-chan?

00:18:33.050 --> 00:18:34.670
I'm so sorry, I'm so sorry!

00:18:34.670 --> 00:18:37.130
I didn't expect you'd be down there...

00:18:37.130 --> 00:18:40.640
Ah, I just had a seizure and collapsed.

00:18:40.640 --> 00:18:41.890
Thanks.

00:18:41.890 --> 00:18:43.310
Yuuko-chan?

00:18:43.310 --> 00:18:44.470
What happen-

00:18:44.970 --> 00:18:46.640
...ed? Huh?

00:18:50.560 --> 00:18:52.150
Sensei, I'm so sorry.

00:18:52.150 --> 00:18:53.440
I didn't see you.

00:18:53.440 --> 00:18:54.690
No, don't be.

00:18:55.030 --> 00:18:58.240
In fact, I'm honored to have been stepped on by you.

00:18:58.700 --> 00:18:59.860
Um,

00:18:59.860 --> 00:19:02.910
Satou-sensei, you seem to like Run.

00:19:02.910 --> 00:19:04.240
What do you like about her?

00:19:05.370 --> 00:19:08.000
The candid way she talks,

00:19:08.000 --> 00:19:10.540
and how she's exactly how she seems...

00:19:10.540 --> 00:19:11.500
That's for sure.

00:19:11.500 --> 00:19:14.380
Plus, she seems like a natural dominatrix.

00:19:15.000 --> 00:19:16.710
Plus her forehead is beautiful.

00:19:16.710 --> 00:19:19.050
Plus the wideness of her forehead is perfect.

00:19:19.050 --> 00:19:20.130
Plus her forehead...

00:19:20.130 --> 00:19:22.010
<i>Th-This teacher...</i>

00:19:23.760 --> 00:19:25.060
Excuse us.

00:19:25.060 --> 00:19:26.390
Come by again any time.

00:19:27.810 --> 00:19:29.810
Class already started.

00:19:29.810 --> 00:19:31.600
Sorry for dragging you two along.

00:19:31.980 --> 00:19:34.940
No worries. You can't underestimate a scrape.

00:19:34.940 --> 00:19:37.030
I got it. I'll be careful.

00:19:37.650 --> 00:19:40.990
I wonder if that Satou-sensei will be all right, though.

00:19:40.990 --> 00:19:41.860
How so?

00:19:42.610 --> 00:19:44.740
He was collapsed earlier, wasn't he?

00:19:44.740 --> 00:19:46.990
Can we just leave him alone?

00:19:47.950 --> 00:19:49.500
I guess I'm a bit worried.

00:19:49.830 --> 00:19:50.410
That's right!

00:19:52.420 --> 00:19:54.000
That teacher's bad news waiting to happen!

00:19:55.340 --> 00:19:56.750
Bad news in what way?

00:19:57.420 --> 00:19:58.590
That teacher...

00:20:02.590 --> 00:20:05.760
h-has some weird tastes.

00:20:07.720 --> 00:20:09.270
Ah, that's what you meant.

00:20:09.270 --> 00:20:12.100
He told me my forehead was pretty!

00:20:12.520 --> 00:20:14.060
That's certainly bad news.

00:20:14.310 --> 00:20:15.150
Right?

00:20:21.030 --> 00:20:22.450
Hmm... well, whatever.

00:20:27.410 --> 00:20:28.120
Toorun,

00:20:28.540 --> 00:20:30.250
could you explain this part to me?

00:20:30.790 --> 00:20:32.910
Sure. What don't you get?

00:20:33.250 --> 00:20:33.920
All of it!

00:20:39.500 --> 00:20:41.630
Then let's start from the beginning.

00:20:41.630 --> 00:20:42.380
Got it!

00:20:43.630 --> 00:20:45.890
Tooru-san's nice, isn't she?

00:20:45.890 --> 00:20:46.680
Yep!

00:20:46.680 --> 00:20:48.510
Why don't you get it?!

00:20:48.810 --> 00:20:50.850
I've explained this so many times!

00:20:50.850 --> 00:20:53.560
I'm sorry! This goes like this, right?

00:20:53.560 --> 00:20:54.730
No, I told you that's wrong!

00:20:54.730 --> 00:20:55.940
You do it like <i>this!</i>

00:20:55.940 --> 00:20:57.690
Meaning here goes like this?

00:20:57.690 --> 00:20:59.440
No, you do it like this!

00:21:02.110 --> 00:21:03.280
Understand?

00:21:05.610 --> 00:21:06.740
Not at all.

00:21:08.240 --> 00:21:09.280
Yutaka!

00:21:09.740 --> 00:21:11.330
Oh, Miporin.

00:21:11.330 --> 00:21:14.330
Yutaka, you've been bothering Tooru-san too much lately.

00:21:14.330 --> 00:21:15.170
Eh?

00:21:16.630 --> 00:21:18.210
Sorry, Tooru-san.

00:21:18.210 --> 00:21:19.840
You don't have to put up with her.

00:21:19.840 --> 00:21:20.960
She's a pain in the rear, isn't she?

00:21:21.380 --> 00:21:22.550
Come on, let's go.

00:21:38.230 --> 00:21:40.690
Look at the trouble you gave Tooru-san!

00:21:40.690 --> 00:21:44.070
If you just can't understand, ask me first, 'kay?

00:21:53.660 --> 00:21:56.290
<i>It's lonely when she's not around...</i>

00:21:57.920 --> 00:21:59.750
<i>... is not what I'm thinking! It's not!</i>

00:22:08.510 --> 00:22:09.180
Tooru!

00:22:09.180 --> 00:22:10.550
Tooru! Wait!

00:22:12.930 --> 00:22:14.720
What's up with Tooru?

00:22:14.720 --> 00:22:15.600
Dunno.

00:22:15.600 --> 00:22:18.480
I give in! Give! Give! Give! Give...

00:22:22.730 --> 00:22:24.280
<i>Because I'm not lonely.</i>

00:23:57.620 --> 00:23:58.500
And so,

00:23:58.500 --> 00:24:01.040
Yutaka and Miporin got a lot of screen time!

00:24:01.040 --> 00:24:02.580
By the way, it's summer already, isn't it?

00:24:02.790 --> 00:24:04.540
Huh? Summer already?

00:24:04.540 --> 00:24:05.540
Isn't it a bit early?

00:24:05.560 --> 00:24:07.630
And that means all sorts of things!

00:24:07.920 --> 00:24:10.380
You know, like swimsuit and hot springs.

00:24:10.380 --> 00:24:12.590
Well, I dunno about the hot springs.

00:24:12.590 --> 00:24:15.010
But before you get in your swimsuit,

00:24:15.010 --> 00:24:16.220
a fearful barrier awaits!

00:24:16.640 --> 00:24:18.180
Next time on A-Channel!

00:24:18.200 --> 00:24:19.310
"Kilogram"!

00:24:19.310 --> 00:24:20.680
Diet, huh?

00:24:20.680 --> 00:24:24.190
With a nice body like Yutaka's, that word has no meaning!
